#QLCIR-G1
# name: detector_refinement_f2_e1_d2
# family: physics/detector-refinement
# expected: UNSAT
# physical: Monotonicity of coarse-grained measurement events / detector-bin merging.
# note: Fine event with 2 outcomes is explicitly included in a coarser event obtained by adding 1 outcomes; asks for a state in fine but outside coarse.
dim(2)
output(4)
1 = or(fine0, fine1)
2 = or(1, extra0)
3 = not(2)
4 = and(1, 3)
